<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 02:07:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>新加坡彻底改革了婴儿奖金计划。这次能有效提高出生率吗？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/singapore-overhauls-baby-bonus-will-it-work-boost-fertility/</link><description>可能不会。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2210258307-e1787920244982.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/singapore-overhauls-baby-bonus-will-it-work-boost-fertility/</guid></item><item><title>这座沙漠城市的市长将美国西部的水危机比作流星计划。 “你可以看到它的到来，但你无法避开”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/us-west-water-crisis-colorado-river-reservoirs-arizona-nevada-california/</link><description>根据垦务局的计划，加利福尼亚州、内华达州和亚利桑那州将总共减少 125 万英亩英尺的用水量。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26239684091406-e1788042975851.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 22:44:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/us-west-water-crisis-colorado-river-reservoirs-arizona-nevada-california/</guid></item><item><title>通过“虚拟减速带”，这些城市通过奖励速度较慢的司机减少红灯数量来减少撞车事故</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virtual-speed-bumps-traffic-accidents-crashes-slower-drivers-fewer-red-lights/</link><description>“如果你现在来到阿尔伯克基，并且正在这条走廊上行驶，你很快就会知道，如果你超速，你就停下来。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26224720456496-e1788040903773.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 22:06:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virtual-speed-bumps-traffic-accidents-crashes-slower-drivers-fewer-red-lights/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲夏季干旱严重，荒漠化威胁日益严重</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/europe-summer-drought-desertification-threat-rivers-fish/</link><description>目前，匈牙利约99%的土地处于严重或极端干旱状态。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26240395440798-e1788040359606.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:55:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/europe-summer-drought-desertification-threat-rivers-fish/</guid></item><item><title>地球正在变得炙热，但“气候沉默”现在在民主党人中很热门。 “人们越来越对其他问题感到害怕”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/midterm-elections-climate-change-hushing-democrats-cost-of-living-trump-iran-war/</link><description>民主党智库探照灯研究所敦促该党停止提及气候变化，因为这不是选民的优先考虑事项。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26239772563593-e1788039807362.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:49:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/midterm-elections-climate-change-hushing-democrats-cost-of-living-trump-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>美国新的制裁将对伊朗普通民众造成沉重打击。当经济崩溃引发新的抗议活动时，这可能就是重点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/iran-economy-us-sanctions-gold-crypto-protests-inflation-naval-blockade/</link><description>“数字资产和黄金是普通伊朗人保护储蓄免受通货膨胀影响的方式。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291440636-e1788034687288.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 21:26:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/iran-economy-us-sanctions-gold-crypto-protests-inflation-naval-blockade/</guid></item><item><title>美联储杰克逊霍尔年度会议的要点</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/key-takeaways-federal-reserve-jackson-hole-conference-kevin-warch/</link><description>在会议间隙发表讲话的欧元区政策制定者也发出了有关通胀的警告。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291882825-e1788033389697.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 20:02:16 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/key-takeaways-federal-reserve-jackson-hole-conference-kevin-warch/</guid></item><item><title>法官规定，特朗普不能驱逐批评以色列的学生，称言论和新闻自由是“美国持久民主的基础”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-deportation-college-students-israel-gaza-war-free-speech-press/</link><description>“如果我们只是‘自由’地表达对政府及其领导人的补充观点，那么言论自由就是虚幻的，”法官写道。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26241613032057.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:53:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-deportation-college-students-israel-gaza-war-free-speech-press/</guid></item><item><title>“特朗普总统去世很久之后，它仍将被称为安大略湖”——省长道格·福特用巨型标语回击“美国湖”法令</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-lake-america-lake-ontario-premier-doug-ford-giant-sign/</link><description>福特身穿加拿大队足球服，在安大略省格里姆斯比附近揭晓了这个标志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2292064316-e1788032417617.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:46:07 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/trump-lake-america-lake-ontario-premier-doug-ford-giant-sign/</guid></item><item><title>华尔街曾经担心过多的美国债务会排挤私营部门。但人工智能超大规模企业正在“反向挤占”财政部</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/us-debt-reverse-crowding-out-effect-ai-hyperscaler-bonds-treasury-yields/</link><description>“流入公司债券的资本就是没有流入国债的资本，而国债收益率必须上升才能出清市场。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291864969-e1787929183229.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 18:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/us-debt-reverse-crowding-out-effect-ai-hyperscaler-bonds-treasury-yields/</guid></item></channel></rss>